## Issue / fix: feat(syntax): add support for hidden_file_extensions

## Description
Closes #2227

This PR adds support for `hidden_file_extensions` from `.sublime-syntax` files. 

The fix strips the leading `.` from hidden dotfiles before looking up the syntax, which allows `syntect`'s extension table to match the hidden files correctly. Verified locally that all tests pass.

