## Issue / fix: Optimize and fix task deletion

## Description
## Related issues

Fixes #5386
Fixes #5827 
Fixes #5832

## Changelog

We fixed longstanding bugs that caused Meilisearch to create orphan batches and to fail to delete tasks from the queue. This issue could stop users from inserting documents, changing settings, or creating indexes. Additionally, we significantly increased the speed of task deletion, thereby speeding up the automatic task deletion process by roughly 3 times.

## Performance

Before:

```
processing tasks                                               1225.000 ms
processing tasks > deleting batches                             794.035 ms
processing tasks > deleting batches > batch                     794.025 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks                                30.805 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks > task                         30.795 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks date time                     398.535 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks date time > task              398.510 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks metadata                        0.040 ms
processing tasks > deleting tasks metadata > task                 0.016 ms
writing tasks to disk                                             0.289 ms
writing tasks to disk > task                                      0.253 ms
```

After:

```
processing tasks                                                444.015 ms
processing tasks > deleting batches                              26.260 ms
processing task

