## Issue / fix: fix: script/predicate blob upload now uses the default max fee estimation tolerance

## Description
- Closes: #1589 
# Release notes

In this release, we:

- Added max fee estimation tolerance to `ScriptCallHandler`'s `convert_into_loader` to reduce the occurrence of invalid max fees.

