                )
                .with_help(
                    "Use one of the following: first, sum, min, max, mean, median, count, last",
                ),
            )),
        },
        Value::Custom { .. } => {
            let expr = NuExpression::try_from_value(plugin, &agg)?;
            Ok(expr.into_polars())
        }
        _ => Err(ShellError::Generic(GenericError::new(
            "Aggregation must be a string or expression",
            "",
            agg.span(),
        ))),
    }
}

